<div class="shopify-policy__container">
  <div class="shopify-policy__title">
    <h1>Age Verification</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="shopify-policy__body">
    <div class="rte">
        <p> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:5px;"><span style="font-weight:400;">We use an industry-recognised third-party system to verify your age. The system runs several independent checks to verify if you are 18 or over, including credit/debit card records, the UK electoral roll and the UK birth register checks. We carry out as few checks as possible; the only time we will check multiple records is if we were unable to verify your age using previous check(s).
</span></p>
<br>
<p style="margin-bottom:5px;"><span style="font-weight:400;">We use AgeChecked, a leading online age verification service provider, to support us in running the necessary checks to verify that you are over the age of 18. They compare your details against millions of records to ensure you are of the correct age to purchase our products. AgeChecked run a ‘soft’ credit check, they are an anonymous system and do not store any data, however they can request it from their providers if they need to investigate a particular customer to verify their age. Once you are verified, you will not need to verify your details again for any future orders. You can find information about AgeChecked and how they manage your personal data by visiting their website: www.agechecked.com. </span></p>
<br>
<p style="margin-bottom:5px;"><span style="font-weight:400;">Below outlines our privacy policy on age verification:</span></p>
<br>
<p style="margin-bottom:5px;"><span style="font-weight:400;">AgeChecked Ltd provides Übbs Pouches with age assurance, identity verification, and watchlist services. AgeChecked are committed to protecting the privacy and security of your personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws, including the General Data Protection Regulation (“GDPR”). This Policy explains how AgeChecked collect, use, and share your personal data when verifying your age via our website.</span></p>
<p><b>Types of Personal Data AgeChecked Collect To Verify Your Age</b></p>
<br>
<p style="margin-bottom:5px;"><span style="font-weight:400;">AgeChecked may collect the following types of personal data about you:</span></p>
<br>
<p style="margin-bottom:5px;"><span style="font-weight:400;">- Identity verification data: this includes your name, date of birth, and other identifying information that we may collect when you submit your personal data to us.<br>
- Age assurance data: this includes information about your age and whether you meet the legal age requirements for our products<br>
- Watchlist data: this includes information about your presence on watchlists or other databases that we may use to verify your identity.</span></p>
<br>
<p><b>How AgeChecked Uses Your Personal Data</b></p>
<br>
<p style="margin-bottom:5px;"><span style="font-weight:400;">AgeChecked will use your personal data for the following purposes:</span></p>
<br>
<p style="margin-bottom:5px;"><span style="font-weight:400;">- To provide age assurance, identity verification, and watchlist services to Übbs Pouches.<br>
- To comply with legal or regulatory obligations that apply to Übbs Pouches;</span></p>
<br>
<p><b>Sharing Your Personal Data</b></p>
<br>
<p style="margin-bottom:5px;"><span style="font-weight:400;">AgeChecked may share your personal data with the following types of third parties:</span></p>
<br>
<p style="margin-bottom:5px;"><span style="font-weight:400;">- Übbs Pouches, who may use your personal data to verify your identity or assess potential risks associated with their business.<br>
- Service providers, who help them provide services or support their business operations, such as IT providers or payment processors.<br>
- Legal or regulatory authorities, where they are required to do so by law or in response to legal process.<br>
- Third parties in connection with a merger, acquisition, or other business transaction involving AgeChecked Ltd.</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
